{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://clayseal.com/", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Clay Seal | runtime security for AI agents</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Runtime security for AI agents. Clay Seal narrows what an agent can do as the task changes. Open-source identity and receipts; design-partner runtime sandbox.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://clayseal.com/\">\n  <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"text/plain\" title=\"LLM context\" href=\"https://clayseal.com/llms.txt\">\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large\">\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#F4F5F2\">\n\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Clay Seal | agents change mid-task. Their permissions should too.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Runtime sandboxing for AI agents. Open-source identity (PyPI) and receipts; each action checked against the live task.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Clay Seal\">\n  <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://clayseal.com/\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://clayseal.com/assets/img/og-card.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Clay Seal runtime security for AI agents. Agents change mid-task; their permissions should too.\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Clay Seal | agents change mid-task. Their permissions should too.\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Runtime sandboxing for AI agents. Clay Seal checks each action against the live task and leaves a verifiable receipt.\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://clayseal.com/assets/img/og-card.png\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Clay Seal runtime security for AI agents.\">\n\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/assets/img/favicon-32.png\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n\n  <link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/assets/fonts/erode-500.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin>\n  <link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/assets/fonts/switzer-400.woff2\" as=\"font\" type=\"font/woff2\" crossorigin>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/css/site.css\">\n\n  <script defer src=\"/assets/js/vendor/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script defer src=\"/assets/js/vendor/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <script defer src=\"/assets/js/site.js\"></script>\n\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@graph\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#org\",\n        \"name\": \"Clay Seal\",\n        \"url\": \"https://clayseal.com/\",\n        \"logo\": \"https://clayseal.com/assets/img/logo-full.png\",\n        \"email\": \"talrejayuvvan@gmail.com\",\n        \"description\": \"Runtime security for AI agents with live scoping and offline-verifiable receipts built on agent identity.\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\"https://github.com/clayseal\", \"https://x.com/claysealhq\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#website\",\n        \"name\": \"Clay Seal\",\n        \"url\": \"https://clayseal.com/\",\n        \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#org\" }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#webpage\",\n        \"url\": \"https://clayseal.com/\",\n        \"name\": \"Clay Seal | runtime security for AI agents\",\n        \"description\": \"Runtime security for AI agents. Clay Seal narrows what an agent can do as the task changes. Out-of-scope actions are blocked, and teams get receipts they can verify later.\",\n        \"isPartOf\": { \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#website\" },\n        \"about\": { \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#org\" },\n        \"primaryImageOfPage\": \"https://clayseal.com/assets/img/og-card.png\",\n        \"dateModified\": \"2026-08-17\",\n        \"inLanguage\": \"en\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n        \"name\": \"clayseal-identity\",\n        \"applicationCategory\": \"DeveloperApplication\",\n        \"operatingSystem\": \"Any\",\n        \"description\": \"Open-source runtime identity for AI agents. Short-lived attested credentials with holder binding and offline verification. Optional MCP FastMCP tool authorization.\",\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\",\n        \"downloadUrl\": \"https://pypi.org/project/clayseal-identity/\",\n        \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\",\n        \"programmingLanguage\": \"Python\",\n        \"isAccessibleForFree\": true,\n        \"offers\": { \"@type\": \"Offer\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\" },\n        \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#org\" }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n        \"name\": \"clayseal-receipts\",\n        \"applicationCategory\": \"DeveloperApplication\",\n        \"operatingSystem\": \"Any\",\n        \"description\": \"Open-source verifiable execution receipts for AI agent actions. Policy wrap with shadow mode and offline verification so audit trails do not depend on Clay Seal being online.\",\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts\",\n        \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts\",\n        \"programmingLanguage\": \"Python\",\n        \"isAccessibleForFree\": true,\n        \"offers\": { \"@type\": \"Offer\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\" },\n        \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#org\" }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://clayseal.com/#faq\",\n        \"mainEntity\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"What is Clay Seal?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Clay Seal is a runtime security layer for AI agents. Instead of trusting the permissions an agent received before a task started, Clay Seal keeps a live sandbox around the agent while it runs. Tool calls are checked against the current task. Allowed actions leave signed receipts, and out-of-scope actions are blocked.\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"How is a dynamic sandbox different from static permissions or OAuth scopes?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A static grant is a guess made before the task starts. It stays live for the whole session. Clay Seal's sandbox narrows as the task takes shape, so the standing attack surface gets smaller instead of staying wide open.\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"What is an action receipt?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Every authorization decision emits a signed receipt recording what happened and which agent did it. Receipts verify offline with the open-source clayseal-receipts tooling, so your audit trail does not depend on Clay Seal being online.\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Does Clay Seal work for multi-agent systems?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. When an orchestrator spawns subagents, each hand-off gives the child only part of the parent's sandbox. Compromising one subagent exposes a sliver of scope, not the whole estate.\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Is Clay Seal open source?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Identity and receipts are open source. Install identity with pip install clayseal-identity (PyPI). Receipts live at github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts. The runtime capability sandbox layer is available to design partners.\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Question\",\n            \"name\": \"Who should use Clay Seal?\",\n            \"acceptedAnswer\": { \"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Teams running AI agents against real systems like payment flows and source control. Clay Seal is currently onboarding design partners.\" }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <!-- Seal stamp, defined once, used everywhere -->\n  <svg class=\"svg-defs\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n    <symbol id=\"seal-stamp\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\">\n      <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"23.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.5 2.5\"/>\n      <path id=\"stamp-arc\" d=\"M 32 12 a 20 20 0 1 1 -0.01 0\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      <text class=\"stamp-arc-text\" font-size=\"6.4\" letter-spacing=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n        <textPath href=\"#stamp-arc\" startOffset=\"0\">CLAY SEAL \u00b7 RUNTIME \u00b7</textPath>\n      </text>\n      <path d=\"M 24.5 32.5 l 5 5 l 10 -11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    </symbol>\n  </svg>\n\n  <header class=\"site-nav\" id=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"wrap nav-row\">\n      <a class=\"nav-brand\" href=\"/\">\n        <span class=\"nav-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span class=\"nav-wordmark\">Clay Seal</span>\n      </a>\n      <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <a href=\"https://lab.clayseal.com\" rel=\"noopener\">Lab</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/yuvvantalreja/clayseal-docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#access\">Become a design partner</a>\n      </nav>\n      <details class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <summary>Menu</summary>\n        <div class=\"nav-menu-panel\">\n          <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n          <a href=\"#receipts\">Receipts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://lab.clayseal.com\" rel=\"noopener\">Lab</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/yuvvantalreja/clayseal-docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>\n          <a href=\"#access\">Become a design partner</a>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 1 \u00b7 hero -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--hero\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow mono\">Now onboarding design partners</p>\n          <h1 class=\"hero-title\">\n            <span class=\"hero-line\">Agents change mid-task.</span>\n            <span class=\"hero-line\">Their permissions should&nbsp;too.</span>\n          </h1>\n          <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n            <div class=\"install-box\">\n              <code>pip install clayseal-identity</code>\n              <button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"pip install clayseal-identity\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\">Copy</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 2 \u00b7 thesis -->\n    <section class=\"thesis\" id=\"thesis\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--thesis\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">02 / thesis</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <p class=\"thesis-text\">\n            <span class=\"thesis-line\">Clay Seal sandboxes agents at runtime.</span>\n            <span class=\"thesis-line\">Each action is checked against</span>\n            <span class=\"thesis-line\">what the task needs now,</span>\n            <span class=\"thesis-line\">not what the agent received at launch.</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 3 \u00b7 the sandbox -->\n    <section class=\"sandbox\" id=\"sandbox\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--sandbox\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">03 / sandbox</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">A sandbox that moves with the task.</h2>\n\n          <figure class=\"sb-fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 460\" fill=\"none\">\n              <!-- the minute-zero grant: a ghost the live sandbox leaves behind -->\n              <rect class=\"sb-ghost\" x=\"60\" y=\"40\" width=\"600\" height=\"380\" rx=\"18\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 7\"/>\n              <text class=\"sb-ghost-label\" x=\"80\" y=\"404\">granted at minute zero</text>\n\n              <!-- permissions: chips stay clay while reachable; the walls leave them gray -->\n              <g class=\"sb-chip\" data-out=\"1\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"108\" y=\"59\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"160\" y=\"79\">customers</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip\" data-out=\"1\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"430\" y=\"370\" width=\"92\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"476\" y=\"390\">deploys</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip\" data-out=\"2\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"452\" y=\"110\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"488\" y=\"130\">files</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip\" data-out=\"2\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"250\" y=\"326\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"300\" y=\"345\">calendar</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip\" data-out=\"3\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"306\" y=\"292\" width=\"72\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"342\" y=\"310\">email</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip sb-chip--kept\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"372\" y=\"178\" width=\"84\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"414\" y=\"197\">orders</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"sb-chip sb-chip--kept\">\n                <rect class=\"chip-bg\" x=\"264\" y=\"244\" width=\"94\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\"/>\n                <text class=\"chip-tx\" x=\"311\" y=\"263\">payments</text>\n              </g>\n\n              <!-- the live sandbox -->\n              <rect class=\"sb-box\" x=\"64\" y=\"44\" width=\"592\" height=\"372\" rx=\"16\"\n                    stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2.25\"/>\n\n              <!-- the agent -->\n              <circle class=\"sb-agent\" cx=\"370\" cy=\"228\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#16181D\"/>\n              <text class=\"sb-agent-label\" x=\"370\" y=\"252\">agent</text>\n\n              <!-- the agent reaches for \"customers\", a permission the walls left behind -->\n              <path class=\"sb-attempt\" d=\"M 370 228 L 296 174\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <path class=\"sb-wallhit\" d=\"M 272 172 L 318 172\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"4.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path class=\"sb-attempt-out\" d=\"M 288 167 L 198 101\" stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n              <path class=\"sb-target-x\" d=\"M 221 69 L 231 79 M 231 69 L 221 79\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <text class=\"sb-void\" x=\"84\" y=\"156\">void: out of scope</text>\n\n              <!-- the wall move itself is sealed -->\n              <g class=\"sb-stamp press-item\" transform=\"translate(458 172)\">\n                <circle r=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -5 0.5 L -1 4.5 L 6 -4\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n\n          <p class=\"sb-cap\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"start\">the sandbox opens with the grant</span><span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"s1\">step 1: customers and deploys leave scope</span><span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"s2\">step 2: files and calendar leave scope</span><span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"s3\">step 3: only orders and payments remain</span><span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"attack\">the agent asks for customers. the wall blocks it</span><span class=\"sb-state\" data-beat=\"sealed\">each wall move is signed</span>\n          </p>\n\n          <p class=\"sb-copy reveal\">\n            The permissions an agent starts with are a guess about everything it\n            might ever need. Clay Seal keeps a live sandbox around the agent\n            instead. The walls move in as the task takes shape, and anything\n            that reaches outside them is blocked, no matter what the original\n            grant allowed.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 4 \u00b7 the replay -->\n    <section class=\"replay\" id=\"replay\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid replay-stage\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--replay\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">04 / replay</p>\n          <p class=\"replay-count mono\">\n            <span class=\"count-step\" data-beat=\"0\">1 / 5</span><span class=\"count-step\" data-beat=\"1\">2 / 5</span><span class=\"count-step\" data-beat=\"2\">3 / 5</span><span class=\"count-step\" data-beat=\"3\">4 / 5</span><span class=\"count-step\" data-beat=\"4\">5 / 5</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">One task, replayed.</h2>\n          <p class=\"replay-sub reveal\">A support agent refunds an order with Clay Seal in the loop.</p>\n\n          <!-- screen readers get the story in full sentences -->\n          <ol class=\"sr-only\">\n            <li>The agent reads order 8841. Allowed and sealed. Scope narrows to this order.</li>\n            <li>It refunds 49 dollars through Stripe. Allowed and sealed.</li>\n            <li>It emails the customer on the order. Allowed and sealed.</li>\n            <li>It tries a bulk customer export. Blocked outside the trajectory. No seal.</li>\n            <li>A signed receipt records all four decisions, verifiable offline.</li>\n          </ol>\n\n          <!-- desktop: the trajectory diagram -->\n          <div class=\"traj\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg class=\"traj-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 380\" fill=\"none\">\n              <!-- the permission envelope: narrows after every sealed action -->\n              <g class=\"traj-band\">\n                <path d=\"M 30 192 L 190 192 L 210 206 L 400 206 L 420 218 L 610 218 L 630 228 L 880 228 L 880 272 L 630 272 L 610 282 L 420 282 L 400 294 L 210 294 L 190 308 L 30 308 Z\"\n                      fill=\"rgba(200,160,136,0.16)\"/>\n                <path class=\"traj-edge\" d=\"M 30 192 L 190 192 L 210 206 L 400 206 L 420 218 L 610 218 L 630 228 L 880 228\"\n                      stroke=\"#C8A088\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n                <path class=\"traj-edge\" d=\"M 30 308 L 190 308 L 210 294 L 400 294 L 420 282 L 610 282 L 630 272 L 880 272\"\n                      stroke=\"#C8A088\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n              </g>\n              <!-- the scope, named -->\n              <text class=\"traj-scope-label\" x=\"46\" y=\"215\">allowed scope</text>\n              <!-- the drift: after three sealed actions, the agent reaches outside -->\n              <path class=\"traj-branch-in\" d=\"M 700 250 C 706 241 709 235 714 226\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n              <path class=\"traj-branch-out\" d=\"M 718 220 C 734 195 752 165 766 143\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n              <path class=\"traj-capbar\" d=\"M 700 219 L 728 235\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-driftnode\" cx=\"774\" cy=\"134\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n              <path class=\"traj-x\" d=\"M 769.5 129.5 L 778.5 138.5 M 778.5 129.5 L 769.5 138.5\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <!-- the path itself -->\n              <path id=\"trajPath\" class=\"traj-path\" d=\"M 30 250 H 870\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2.25\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-ring\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-ring\" cx=\"410\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-ring\" cx=\"620\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-node\" cx=\"200\" cy=\"250\" r=\"5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-node\" cx=\"410\" cy=\"250\" r=\"5\"/>\n              <circle class=\"traj-node\" cx=\"620\" cy=\"250\" r=\"5\"/>\n              <!-- seals press onto allowed actions -->\n              <g class=\"traj-stamp press-item\" transform=\"translate(200 250)\">\n                <circle r=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -5 0.5 L -1 4.5 L 6 -4\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"traj-stamp press-item\" transform=\"translate(410 250)\">\n                <circle r=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -5 0.5 L -1 4.5 L 6 -4\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"traj-stamp press-item\" transform=\"translate(620 250)\">\n                <circle r=\"12.5\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.25\"/>\n                <path d=\"M -5 0.5 L -1 4.5 L 6 -4\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </g>\n              <!-- the receipt at the end of the narrowed envelope -->\n              <g class=\"traj-chip\">\n                <rect x=\"822\" y=\"222\" width=\"72\" height=\"58\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#E9E9E4\" stroke=\"#D6D7D1\"/>\n                <path d=\"M 822 228 H 894\" stroke=\"#F4F5F2\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3.5\"/>\n                <path d=\"M 834 244 H 882 M 834 254 H 874 M 834 264 H 866\" stroke=\"#D6D7D1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <g class=\"traj-chipstamp press-item\" transform=\"translate(886 226)\">\n                  <circle r=\"10\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                  <path d=\"M -4 0.5 L -1 3.5 L 5 -3.5\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                </g>\n                <text class=\"traj-chip-label\" x=\"858\" y=\"300\">receipt</text>\n              </g>\n              <!-- the agent, riding its own trajectory -->\n              <g class=\"traj-agent\">\n                <circle cx=\"870\" cy=\"250\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16181D\"/>\n                <text class=\"traj-agent-label\" x=\"870\" y=\"236\">agent</text>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n            <p class=\"traj-label\" style=\"left:22.2%; top:84%\">reads order #8841</p>\n            <p class=\"traj-label\" style=\"left:45.6%; top:84%\">refunds $49.00</p>\n            <p class=\"traj-label\" style=\"left:68.9%; top:84%\">emails the customer</p>\n            <p class=\"traj-label traj-label--drift\" style=\"left:84%; top:14%\">tries a bulk customer export</p>\n            <p class=\"traj-void\" style=\"left:84%; top:22%\">void: outside scope</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- mobile: the same beats, stacked -->\n          <ol class=\"traj-mobile\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <li class=\"tm-row\" data-beat=\"read\">\n              <span class=\"tm-dot\"></span>\n              <p class=\"tm-text\">reads order #8841</p>\n              <span class=\"tm-stamp press-item\">\u2713</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"tm-row\" data-beat=\"refund\">\n              <span class=\"tm-dot\"></span>\n              <p class=\"tm-text\">refunds $49.00 <span class=\"tm-sub\">cap derived from the order it just read</span></p>\n              <span class=\"tm-stamp press-item\">\u2713</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"tm-row\" data-beat=\"email\">\n              <span class=\"tm-dot\"></span>\n              <p class=\"tm-text\">emails the customer</p>\n              <span class=\"tm-stamp press-item\">\u2713</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"tm-row tm-row--void\" data-beat=\"drift\">\n              <span class=\"tm-x\">\u00d7</span>\n              <p class=\"tm-text\">tries a bulk customer export <span class=\"tm-sub tm-sub--void\">void: outside trajectory</span></p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"tm-row tm-row--receipt\" data-beat=\"receipt\">\n              <span class=\"tm-dot tm-dot--receipt\"></span>\n              <p class=\"tm-text\">receipt: 4 actions, verifiable offline</p>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n\n          <p class=\"traj-cap\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"start\">scope: everything the grant allows</span><span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"read\">scope: order #8841 only</span><span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"refund\">scope: refund \u2264 $49.00</span><span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"email\">scope: + one customer address</span><span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"drift\">scope: held. request outside the envelope</span><span class=\"traj-state\" data-beat=\"receipt\">sealed. receipt issued for 4 actions</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 5 \u00b7 delegation -->\n    <section class=\"atten\" id=\"delegation\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--atten\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">05 / delegation</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">Delegation narrows.</h2>\n\n          <figure class=\"at-fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 344\" fill=\"none\">\n              <!-- the orchestrator's sandbox -->\n              <g class=\"at-parent\">\n                <rect class=\"at-box at-draw\" x=\"230\" y=\"24\" width=\"260\" height=\"96\" rx=\"12\"\n                      fill=\"rgba(200,160,136,0.16)\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <text class=\"at-name\" x=\"360\" y=\"66\">orchestrator</text>\n                <text class=\"at-scope\" x=\"360\" y=\"92\">scope: the whole task</text>\n              </g>\n\n              <!-- spawning paths for each subagent -->\n              <path class=\"at-path\" data-child=\"1\" d=\"M 360 120 L 360 168 L 143 168 L 143 232\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path class=\"at-path\" data-child=\"2\" d=\"M 360 168 L 360 232\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path class=\"at-path\" data-child=\"3\" d=\"M 360 168 L 555 168 L 555 232\"\n                    stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n              <!-- each child holds a visibly smaller sandbox than its parent -->\n              <g class=\"at-child\" data-child=\"1\">\n                <rect class=\"at-box at-draw\" x=\"48\" y=\"232\" width=\"190\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\"\n                      fill=\"rgba(200,160,136,0.16)\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n                <text class=\"at-name\" x=\"143\" y=\"282\">researcher</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"at-child\" data-child=\"2\">\n                <rect class=\"at-box at-draw\" x=\"288\" y=\"232\" width=\"144\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\"\n                      fill=\"rgba(200,160,136,0.16)\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n                <text class=\"at-name\" x=\"360\" y=\"278\">operator</text>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"at-child\" data-child=\"3\">\n                <rect class=\"at-box at-draw\" x=\"498\" y=\"232\" width=\"114\" height=\"72\" rx=\"10\"\n                      fill=\"rgba(200,160,136,0.16)\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n                <text class=\"at-name\" x=\"555\" y=\"274\">notifier</text>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </figure>\n\n          <p class=\"at-copy reveal\">\n            When an orchestrator spawns subagents, every hand-off attenuates:\n            a child holds only part of its parent's sandbox. Each delegation is\n            sealed like any other action. Compromise a subagent and you've\n            reached a sliver, not the estate.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 6 \u00b7 how it works -->\n    <section class=\"how\" id=\"how\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--how\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">06 / protocol</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">How the seal gets made.</h2>\n          <ol class=\"steps\">\n            <li class=\"step-card\">\n              <span class=\"step-num mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>\n              <svg class=\"step-glyph\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <rect class=\"glyph-draw\" x=\"32\" y=\"26\" width=\"56\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <circle class=\"glyph-draw\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"52\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path class=\"glyph-draw\" d=\"M 44 84 C 48 71 72 71 76 84\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path class=\"glyph-draw glyph-arc\" d=\"M 60 8 A 52 52 0 1 1 15 34\" stroke=\"#C8A088\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"34\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#C8A088\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <p class=\"step-eyebrow mono\">step 1: attest</p>\n              <h3>Attest</h3>\n              <p>The agent gets a short-lived identity bound to its own key.\n                 No standing API keys to leak, nothing to rotate.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"step-card\">\n              <span class=\"step-num mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>\n              <svg class=\"step-glyph\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <circle class=\"glyph-outer\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"46\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n                <circle class=\"glyph-outer\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"31\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"1.75\"/>\n                <circle class=\"glyph-draw\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#C8A088\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <p class=\"step-eyebrow mono\">step 2: scope per action</p>\n              <h3>Scope per action</h3>\n              <p>Each tool call is authorized against the trajectory so far.\n                 What the agent just did decides what it can do next.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"step-card\">\n              <span class=\"step-num mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span>\n              <svg class=\"step-glyph\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <rect class=\"glyph-draw\" x=\"36\" y=\"30\" width=\"48\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path class=\"glyph-draw\" d=\"M 46 78 H 74 M 46 86 H 66\" stroke=\"#63665F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <g class=\"glyph-stamp press-item\">\n                  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"52\" r=\"17\" fill=\"#C8A088\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n                  <path d=\"M 52.5 52 L 58 57.5 L 68 46\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                </g>\n              </svg>\n              <p class=\"step-eyebrow mono\">step 3: seal</p>\n              <h3>Seal</h3>\n              <p>Every decision emits a signed receipt. Verify it offline\n                 without calling Clay Seal.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 6 \u00b7 receipts -->\n    <section class=\"receipts\" id=\"receipts\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--receipts\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">07 / receipt</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body receipts-grid\">\n          <div class=\"receipts-copy\">\n            <h2 class=\"reveal\">Receipts, not promises.</h2>\n            <p class=\"reveal\">\n              Every decision leaves a receipt you can verify without us. If Clay Seal\n              disappears tomorrow, your audit trail still checks out.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"verify-motif reveal\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 84\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                <path class=\"verify-sig\" d=\"M 16 56 C 34 30 44 66 60 48 C 74 32 82 62 100 46 C 112 36 118 52 132 46 S 158 40 170 46\"\n                      stroke=\"#16181D\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <circle class=\"verify-ring\" cx=\"228\" cy=\"42\" r=\"24\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path class=\"verify-check\" d=\"M 217 43 L 225 51 L 240 33\" stroke=\"#8A5A40\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <p class=\"verify-cap\">verifies offline. no vendor call.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <figure class=\"receipt-card reveal\">\n            <figcaption class=\"mono receipt-head\">clay seal \u00b7 action receipt</figcaption>\n            <dl class=\"receipt-fields\">\n              <div><dt>action</dt><dd>Refund via Stripe</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>scope</dt><dd>order #8841 \u00b7 up to $49.00</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>decision</dt><dd>Allowed. sealed \u2713</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>identity</dt><dd>support-bot@acme \u00b7 attested \u00b7 300s&nbsp;TTL</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>signature</dt><dd class=\"mono\">ed25519 9f2c\u2026b417</dd></div>\n            </dl>\n            <span class=\"seal-stamp seal-stamp--card\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><use href=\"#seal-stamp\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 7 \u00b7 open source -->\n    <section class=\"oss\" id=\"open-source\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--oss\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">08 / open source</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body oss-strip reveal\">\n          <p class=\"oss-lede\">Identity and receipts are open source.</p>\n          <div class=\"install-box\">\n            <code>pip install clayseal-identity</code>\n            <button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"pip install clayseal-identity\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\">Copy</button>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"oss-links mono\">\n            <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\" rel=\"noopener\">Identity</a> \u00b7\n            <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/clayseal-identity/\" rel=\"noopener\">PyPI</a> \u00b7\n            <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts\" rel=\"noopener\">Receipts</a> \u00b7\n            <a href=\"https://github.com/yuvvantalreja/clayseal-docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a> \u00b7\n            <a href=\"/llms.txt\" rel=\"noopener\">llms.txt</a>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 8 \u00b7 questions -->\n    <section class=\"faq\" id=\"faq\">\n      <div class=\"wrap section-grid\">\n        <div class=\"spine-col\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"spine spine--faq\"></div>\n          <p class=\"spine-tick mono\">09 / questions</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"section-body\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">Questions.</h2>\n          <div class=\"faq-list\">\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>What is Clay Seal?</summary>\n              <p>Clay Seal is a runtime security layer for AI agents. Instead of\n                 trusting the permissions an agent received before a task started,\n                 Clay Seal keeps a live sandbox around the agent while it runs.\n                 Tool calls are checked against the current task. Allowed actions\n                 leave signed receipts, and out-of-scope actions are blocked.</p>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>How is a dynamic sandbox different from static permissions or OAuth scopes?</summary>\n              <p>A static grant is a guess made before the task starts. It stays\n                 live for the whole session. Clay Seal's sandbox narrows as the\n                 task takes shape, so the standing attack surface gets smaller\n                 instead of staying wide open.</p>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>What is an action receipt?</summary>\n              <p>Every authorization decision emits a signed receipt recording\n                 what happened and which agent did it. Receipts verify offline\n                 with the open-source tooling, so your audit trail does not\n                 depend on Clay Seal being online.</p>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>Does Clay Seal work for multi-agent systems?</summary>\n              <p>Yes. When an orchestrator spawns subagents, each hand-off gives\n                 the child only part of the parent's sandbox. Compromising one\n                 subagent exposes a sliver of scope, not the whole estate.</p>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>Is Clay Seal open source?</summary>\n              <p>Identity and receipts are open source. Install identity with\n                 <code>pip install clayseal-identity</code>\n                 (<a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/clayseal-identity/\" rel=\"noopener\">(PyPI)</a>.\n                 Receipts are at\n                 <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts\" rel=\"noopener\">clayseal/clayseal-receipts</a>\n                 and emit offline-verifiable action receipts.\n                 The runtime capability sandbox is available to\n                 <a href=\"#access\">design partners</a>.</p>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-item reveal\">\n              <summary>Who should use Clay Seal?</summary>\n              <p>Teams running AI agents against real systems like payment flows\n                 and source control. Clay Seal helps them reduce standing access\n                 and keep a verifiable audit trail.\n                 We're currently onboarding <a href=\"#access\">design partners</a>.</p>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============================================== 9 \u00b7 cta -->\n    <section class=\"cta\" id=\"access\">\n      <div class=\"wrap\">\n        <div class=\"cta-inner\">\n          <h2 class=\"reveal\">Seal your first agent this week.</h2>\n          <p class=\"reveal\">\n            We're onboarding a small set of design partners running agents against\n            real systems like payment flows and source control. The open-source\n            identity and receipts packages are yours either way.\n          </p>\n          <form class=\"waitlist-form reveal\" data-endpoint=\"https://clayseal-waitlist-060a18.azurewebsites.net/v1/waitlist\" novalidate>\n            <label for=\"wl-email\">Work email</label>\n            <div class=\"form-row\">\n              <input id=\"wl-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required\n                     autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"submit\">Request access</button>\n            </div>\n            <input class=\"hp-field\" type=\"text\" name=\"company_website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <p class=\"form-error\" hidden></p>\n          </form>\n          <div class=\"form-success\" hidden>\n            <span class=\"seal-stamp seal-stamp--form\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><use href=\"#seal-stamp\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <p>You're on the list. Sealed.</p>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"live-region sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"footer-cols mono\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer-head\">Product</p>\n          <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n          <a href=\"#replay\">The replay</a>\n          <a href=\"#receipts\">Receipts</a>\n          <a href=\"#open-source\">Open source</a>\n          <a href=\"#faq\">Questions</a>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer-head\">Resources</p>\n          <a href=\"https://lab.clayseal.com\" rel=\"noopener\">Lab</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-identity\" rel=\"noopener\">Identity</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal/clayseal-receipts\" rel=\"noopener\">Receipts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/clayseal-identity/\" rel=\"noopener\">PyPI</a>\n          <a href=\"/llms.txt\" rel=\"noopener\">llms.txt</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/yuvvantalreja/clayseal-docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"footer-head\">Connect</p>\n          <a href=\"https://x.com/claysealhq\" rel=\"noopener\">X (Twitter)</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/clayseal\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a>\n          <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy policy</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-seal emboss-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <p class=\"footer-fine mono\">\u00a9 2026 Clay Seal. Runtime security for AI agents. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 1190}